          <p>YouTube search and analytics, Instagram profile data, plus LinkedIn company, jobs &amp; profile data. From <span class="accent">$0.01/1K</span> calls.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <svg class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/>
          </svg>
          <h3>Rich SERP Data</h3>
          <p>Organic results, AI Overviews, Featured Snippets, PAA, ads, related searches, shopping, videos — full JSON.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <svg class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/>
          </svg>
          <h3>Automatic Refunds</h3>
          <p>Requests we could not complete are <span class="accent">refunded automatically</span>; a 404 for a resource that does not exist is an answer and is charged.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
